      <SupplementalInformationDetail>
        <FormAndLineReferenceDesc>Governing body decisions Part VI line 7b</FormAndLineReferenceDesc>
        <ExplanationTxt>Daily business decisions are made the governing board. Changes in the board or policies are brought to the general membership for approval by majority vote. The governing board is required to report to the membership the state of business, expenditures and other information regarding the operations of the lodge.</ExplanationTxt>
