      <SupplementalInformationDetail>
        <FormAndLineReferenceDesc>Form 990 governing body review Part VI line 11</FormAndLineReferenceDesc>
        <ExplanationTxt>Lodge officer, house committee and general membership meetings are held twice per month. The Form 990 is reviewed during these meeting prior to submission to the Internal Revenue Service</ExplanationTxt>
      </SupplementalInformationDetail>
